Package: BaMeta
Type: Package
Title: Bias-Aware Meta-Analysis with Bounded Study Biases
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Mingxuan", "Zou", email = "mingxuanzou@uchicago.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Mingxuan Zou [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Mingxuan Zou <mingxuanzou@uchicago.edu>
Description: Implements bias-aware meta-analysis for independent study
    estimates with fixed, bounded biases. Provides folded-normal sensitivity
    intervals, maximum bias for significance, noncentral chi-square model
    checking, minimum bias for compatibility, fixed-effect and random-effects
    summaries, and descriptive calibration diagnostics. Produces manuscript
    tables, sensitivity curves, and calibration histograms. Includes the
    reconstructed Williams example used by Zou and Ding (2026).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/mingxuanzou/BaMeta
BugReports: https://github.com/mingxuanzou/BaMeta/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, utils

